                  <story-point caption='Recommendations for EV Market Growth&#10;&#10;Manufacturers should focus on high-performing vehicle categories, improve battery capacity and driving range, and enhance customer satisfaction. Investing in advanced battery technologies, affordable EV models, and better customer service can help strengthen market competitiveness and support sustainable transportation. ' captured-sheet='EV Market Analysis' id='1'>
